{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0414_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_intro_1000_p", "source_sha256": "fcae2c2c0c160c85df6dec0252ce009f82aaa8dd0a4ead6d4ca7994ce3e6f0a1", "ja": "青羽さん、お疲れさまです。", "zh": "青羽小姐，辛苦了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0414_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_intro_1001_102mis", "source_sha256": "dc1431f71fee39d58c09dbe51435da7e0daf68c562146b5d27f711b8c4eab923", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}さん！\n今、何かひそひそ話とかしてませんでした？", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！\n刚才是不是在说什么悄悄话？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0414_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_intro_1002_p", "source_sha256": "2018fc46e8ac7cb5f4e75419f120168329dbef0dbda74d48aac65af451f8c8d0", "ja": "えっ？　いえ、特には……\nここに来るまで一人でしたし。", "zh": "咦？没有，没什么特别的……\n我来这里之前一直是一个人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0414_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_intro_1003_102mis", "source_sha256": "aea424a2444752b1d6c39d61b88d0b749cd1b781ba46f0280f95befb6eeee21d", "ja": "で、ですよね！\nすみません、おかしいなぁ。", "zh": "对、对吧！\n抱歉，真奇怪啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0414_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_intro_1004_102mis", "source_sha256": "87c2479a5c19aaefad66aa92a4ef1572fc7c78f77afb2ba9b3abeac6689fb16b", "ja": "誰もいないところから、声が聞こえてきた気がして\n……うぅ、私、疲れているのかなぁ。", "zh": "我好像听到了从空无一人的地方传来的声音……\n……呜，我是不是太累了呀。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0414_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_intro_1005_p", "source_sha256": "96fde53b2ffc144529ab2793a7b90038227c9d95ad762e587a353d19f7008fca", "ja": "休める時は休んでくださいね。……とは言いつつ、\nすみません、今日は留守番をお願いしたいんですけど。", "zh": "能休息的时候就请好好休息吧。……虽然这么说，\n不好意思，今天想拜托你留守一下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0414_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_intro_1006_102mis", "source_sha256": "fa1fe5e2511bdab252e3bcfa120d31246fa98528ad140c2ca0a5aa4606261ddf", "ja": "あ、社長さんに呼ばれているんですよね！\n大丈夫ですよ、しっかり留守番しておきますから。", "zh": "啊，社长叫您过去对吧！\n没问题，我会好好留守的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0414_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_intro_1007_102mis", "source_sha256": "74bf971b9a4c42dcf7f82c8e94f077d6a1f9984798f00185b042c084a0de87fe", "ja": "ごめんなさい、変なことを言ってしまって。\nお気になさらず、いってらっしゃ～い！", "zh": "对不起，说了些奇怪的话。\n请别放在心上，您慢走～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0414_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_intro_1008_p", "source_sha256": "012c7a29972d24eaf513c82af129d0352a16f3c12abd4cad4137eefd147e226c", "ja": "そうですか？　それなら助かりますけど、\nくれぐれも無理はしないでくださいね。", "zh": "这样啊？那就好，不过请千万别勉强自己。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0414_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_intro_1009_102mis", "source_sha256": "0dc8fe092b0ef7a3c5b7758a2939555cd512012dac932f94e9cbfb8902a4e8fe", "ja": "はい。{$P$}さんもお気をつけて！", "zh": "好的。{$P$}先生也请多加小心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0414_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_intro_1010_102mis", "source_sha256": "5bb12c095f4b4675b112ddd55a6784696310f05589c9af0b3b5ee369e23667df", "ja": "……。さっきの、なんだったんだろう～。\n空耳かな？　怪談の季節じゃないのに……。", "zh": "……刚才那到底是什么呀～  \n是我听错了吗？明明还没到讲鬼故事的季节……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0414_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_intro_1011_102mis", "source_sha256": "8729668fa0ea15c9b8f147710aaa48da4be71fb5f67baadd78a6e4c5eaa80f29", "ja": "温暖化が進んでるし、今の幽霊は冬にも出るのかも？\nうぅ……ダメダメ、しっかり留守番しなきゃ！", "zh": "全球变暖越来越严重了，说不定现在的幽灵冬天也会出现吧？\n呜呜……不行不行，我得好好看家才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0414_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_intro_1012_null", "source_sha256": "b51dfd95602ddeba2076b904866bddd2d33de5044a97d39d914d7a5836a1edaa", "ja": "そして…………", "zh": "然后…………", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0414_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_intro_1013_president", "source_sha256": "2f43756d3e9f13722856cced67c3dec7b4aaaf617678a79568683b32c3a257d4", "ja": "『BATTLE OF THEATER』、早くも6戦目だ。\nアイドル諸君も、戦いに慣れてきた頃じゃないかな？", "zh": "“BATTLE OF THEATER”这么快就迎来第6战了。\n各位偶像差不多也已经习惯战斗了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0414_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_intro_1014_p", "source_sha256": "44bba1f5f48b9b05140dbac198ed8619fec813ceafcdf812777cf472a587ac20", "ja": "はい。\nみんな、よく健闘していると思います。", "zh": "是的。\n我觉得大家都表现得很不错。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0414_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_intro_1015_president", "source_sha256": "ecc4c9f480ea4f1a83fde89b35ca3845996546c1012ae5952b3c4b610b3534d6", "ja": "評判は、私の耳にも届いているとも。……だが、\nそろそろ新しいステージを見てみたいと思わんかね？", "zh": "你的名声，我也有所耳闻。……不过，\n难道你不想看看新的舞台吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0414_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_intro_1016_p", "source_sha256": "58f1e1ac73b6038b852268c21e7b5854daf64f25d09b6f93c5c3502af86a9f0d", "ja": "と、言いますと？", "zh": "这么说是什么意思？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0414_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_intro_1017_president", "source_sha256": "4ed04ec3ca681b8d516203a7e9d9c2a849d132897a6c38d642d730aafa824149", "ja": "ふふふ、それは……\nズバリ、同タイプ・グループ対決だよ！", "zh": "嘿嘿嘿，那就是……\n没错，同类型·小组对决！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0414_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_intro_1018_p", "source_sha256": "2830e0f37c2486c1181014da8ec0a9e7839da8655b5de5ebfb46460f961c6f07", "ja": "同タイプ！？　つまりPrincessはPrincessと、\nAngelはAngel同士で戦うと……！", "zh": "同属性！？　也就是说Princess要和Princess，\nAngel要和Angel相互对抗吗……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0414_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_intro_1019_101kot", "source_sha256": "449c5948f9278b15fbfcee7dd3f5566281cdbf28f883625c47ca2d3cb6dea22f", "ja": "より仲間意識の強い、同タイプのアイドル同士を\n対決させるなんて……社長、恐ろしい人……！", "zh": "让同伴意识更强烈的同属性偶像彼此对决……\n社长，真是个可怕的人……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0414_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_intro_1020_p", "source_sha256": "8fafb2f0167f4a95db47a82101613b75e36be4acbfd90a0ccb7d4d3eba1ba07b", "ja": "確かに……ここのところ、そうストレートな\n対決姿勢はあまり打ち出してこなかったですね。", "zh": "确实……最近这段时间，没怎么摆出那么直接的\n对决姿态呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0414_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_intro_1021_p", "source_sha256": "65eefd28030843c0813f9918d91d8af28e366a84b2a8e76bb23a76cec28e4f3b", "ja": "今なら、注目を集めるかも……？", "zh": "现在的话，说不定能吸引大家的注意……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0414_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_intro_1022_president", "source_sha256": "1f022297b70e821766d4076a88fdc6dde9e43746f722dbc5f472bab375001e7e", "ja": "そうだろう、そうだろう！　はっはっは。", "zh": "就是嘛，就是嘛！哈哈哈。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0414_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_intro_1023_101kot", "source_sha256": "b6edd3ee918d447d90ceb888123f1a8ee1f51b1260a7c4498e234214d91a10e3", "ja": "社長はこの頃、群雄割拠を描いた\n歴史ドラマにはまっているんですよね。", "zh": "社长最近迷上了描写群雄割据的历史剧呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0414_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_intro_1024_president", "source_sha256": "a37236d5254c53f230990cbd0e35459172cab0b32473a86e09a760f1dcf3dab4", "ja": "お、音無君……！　これはドラマの影響ではなく、\nかねてから温めていた構想でだね……。", "zh": "啊，音无……！这并不是受电视剧影响，而是我之前一直酝酿着的构想……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0414_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_intro_1025_p", "source_sha256": "7bc5e13850083b5c8a5b0ed27111a2d0100ddefb28672b248fde1286d42a3c5b", "ja": "同グループだからこそ、ライバルとして意識する\nアイドルもいるかと。熱い戦いになりそうですね！", "zh": "正因为是同一个组合，所以才会有把彼此\n视为对手的偶像吧。感觉会是一场热血的对决呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0414_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_intro_1026_101kot", "source_sha256": "13c4c3b7eb3ff75d61b8d653fcf7d4c510b974696d027972cfa514a240e7bb69", "ja": "そう、同じグループ、仲間だからこそ……！\n真剣勝負って、いつの世もときめくものですものね♪", "zh": "对，正因为是同一个组合、是伙伴……！\n认真较量，无论在什么时候都令人心潮澎湃呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0414_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_intro_1027_president", "source_sha256": "e86a5cf04b3bb9340254b04b4dfeb1fd12a3661c0fa1170d9dadd3a5e6d5eef7", "ja": "音無君……そういえば君も、このところ\nスポーツバトルものの漫画にはまっていたような。", "zh": "音无君……说起来，你最近好像也迷上了运动对战类漫画。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0414_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_intro_1028_101kot", "source_sha256": "e20c48c4e6f546eaf920cfb65113875559bf39d83d8f3f1152392871d14a6f89", "ja": "ピヨッ！？　しゃ、社長、どうしてそれを！", "zh": "咕！？社、社长，您怎么知道的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0414_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_intro_1029_p", "source_sha256": "1b696aa19d04b577f1cb53189289de63c371fc77b8436bdc10b0ae2c94a3a763", "ja": "しかし、これまで以上に激戦になりそうですね。\n精神面でも、しっかりフォローしないと……。", "zh": "不过，看起来会比以往更加激烈啊。\n精神方面也必须好好支持才行……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0414_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_intro_1030_president", "source_sha256": "7564526beb4adf21fcc2d8f9aaa7730d7dbc6cfd0dde2a12bf474643302a61d9", "ja": "うむ！　それも含めて、どうかね？\nいけそうかね？", "zh": "嗯！包括那个在内，怎么样？\n行得通吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0414_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_intro_1031_p", "source_sha256": "e88e022561cda3857f67f11b07e74c184918d3cfdc54685073dec2c308c2ddce", "ja": "はい！　今のみんななら、きっと大丈夫です！", "zh": "是！现在的大家一定没问题！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0414_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_intro_1032_president", "source_sha256": "fcf7f6659f0932026c9506073e6b8b712b793aa478701a67184813d9d3e216df", "ja": "よし、君のプロデューサーとしての判断を信頼して、\n任せるとしよう。よろしく頼んだよ～！", "zh": "好，我相信你作为制作人的判断，\n就交给你了。拜托你啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
